  "description": "QUALITY. COMFORT. PERFORMANCE. STYLE. E-Trekking has been one of the strongest segments in the KTM portfolio for many years. With MACINA GRAN, MACINA STYLE and MACINA TOUR, the trekking range offers three distinct characters for different riding needs – all united by the same commitment to quality, comfort and reliable performance. With 55 mm tires, the MACINA STYLE represents the versatile all-rounder within the trekking range. Comfortable, sporty and well-balanced, it combines everyday practicality with the dynamics needed for longer distances. Here too, every model comes equipped with the Bosch Performance Line CX and an 800 Wh PowerTube as standard. All three model ranges are built around a robust aluminium frame with clean integration and modern trekking geometry. For convenient battery handling, KTM once again relies on its proven POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL) system, allowing the battery to be easily removed upwards from the downtube and just as effortlessly reinserted.",
